#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.STATUS.WAITING_WORKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.STATUS.WAITING_WORKER"
